# AI safety

- The AI plane has no flight-control authority: no arm, takeoff, land, return-to-launch, setpoint, or geofence write.
- Tools are READ_ONLY, DRAFT, HUMAN_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED, or PROHIBITED_TO_AI.
- Do not give the model raw SQL, unrestricted storage, or a universal database tool.
- Delete, approve, permission changes, and safety actions are prohibited or require a recorded human confirmation.
- Persist model, model version, prompt version, tool calls, evidence ids, and reviewer result for operational conclusions.
- A model change needs an evaluation record.
